WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.150
A ship at A sights a lighthouse on
a bearing of oh four oh degrees.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:08.490
It sails ten kilometres due north to B.

3
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:12.320
Now the lighthouse is on a
bearing of one two oh degrees.

4
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:16.980
Join the three points: a triangle
with no right angle anywhere.

5
00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.330
So how far is B from the lighthouse?

6
00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:22.620
Can you find it without a right angle?

7
00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.260
In this mission, you'll turn bearings
into the angles inside a triangle.

8
00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:30.260
You'll label each side to
match the angle opposite it,

9
00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:32.790
so every side has a partner angle.

10
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:37.840
And you'll use the sine rule: each side
divided by the sine of its opposite angle

11
00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.600
gives the same value.

12
00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:44.200
Your mission: work out how far the
ship at B is from the lighthouse.
